    "eventDetail": "<p>Join Dena Salamon as she discussing the following learning objectives for this CE course: </p>\r\n<p>* Define retained surgical items <br />\r\n* List the clinical, financial, and legal implications of RSI <br />\r\n* Review current practices for prevention of RSI <br />\r\n* Discuss available practices and technology to prevent RSI </p>\r\n<p>This CE course will provide 1 CE credit for registered nurses, sterile processing technicians, and surgical techs.</p>\r\n",
